infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Skip a layer, book an incident
  desc Each cross-cutting concern omitted is not a smaller service — it is a named production outage
  lists
    - label No error boundary
      desc Raw stack traces and DB internals leak to clients; an unexpected throw crashes instead of a clean 500
    - label Blocked event loop
      desc One inline CPU call queues every request behind it — p99 jumps from 40 ms to 9 s
    - label No graceful shutdown
      desc SIGTERM with no drain: in-flight checkouts dropped on every deploy, hard-killed after 30 s
    - label Unvalidated input
      desc A crafted query string reaches an unparameterized SQL string — injection and corruption
    - label Config baked into the image
      desc One artifact cannot promote across environments and a secret ends up committed to git
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #6366f1
